    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d38">

                <pb facs="0155" n="47" sameAs="frus:frus1893/pg47"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Gresham to Mr.
                            Thompson.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1893-09-09"><hi rendition="#italic">September 9,
                        1893</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Mr. Gresham informs Mr. Thompson that the U. S. S. <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Detroit</hi> has been ordered to proceed to Rio de Janeiro and that the <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Charleston</hi> will probably arrive there on this
                    day.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
